kitEvidence.formula:
Hwei paints visions of disaster that deal large damage to enemies.

{{Spell_HweiQQ_Name}}
Hwei launches a blazing fast fireball that explodes on the first enemy hit, dealing [50 / 80 / 110 / 140 / 170 + (0.8) × AP] plus [3 / 4 / 5 / 6 / 7]% max health magic damage.

{{Spell_HweiQW_Name}}
Hwei strikes over far distances with a delayed lightning bolt, dealing [60 / 85 / 110 / 135 / 160 + (0.3) × AP] magic damage. Hitting an Isolated or Immobilized target increases the damage up to [(60 / 85 / 110 / 135 / 160 + (0.3) × AP) × (2 / 2.375 / 2.75 / 3.125 / 3.5)] magic damage, based on the target's missing health.

{{Spell_HweiQE_Name}}
Hwei unleashes a path of eruptions, dealing [20 / 35 / 50 / 65 / 80 + (0.3) × AP] magic damage in an area and leaving behind pools of lava that Slow enemies by @spell.HweiQE:SlowPercent@% and deal [20 / 35 / 50 / 65 / 80 + (0.24) × AP] magic damage per second for @spell.HweiQE:Duration@ seconds.
